# permanent (CR 602.2b). Equipped with Deconstruction Hammer - itself a noncreature spell cast that turn - Traxos has
# "{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Deconstruction Hammer: Destroy target artifact or enchantment", which still costs {3}: two Moxen
# cannot pay it, and a third mana (the Island) can, leaving nothing over.

